    markdown:
      "## search\n\n`client.cms.siteSearch.search(analytics?: boolean, autocomplete?: boolean, boostLimit?: number, boostRecent?: string, domain?: string[], groupId?: number[], hubdbQuery?: string, language?: string, length?: 'LONG' | 'SHORT', limit?: number, matchPrefix?: boolean, offset?: number, pathPrefix?: string[], popularityBoost?: number, property?: string[], q?: string, tableId?: number, type?: string[], types?: string[]): { limit: number; offset: number; page: number; results: content_search_result[]; total: number; searchTerm?: string; }`\n\n**get** `/cms/site-search/2026-03/search`\n\nReturns any website content matching the given search criteria for a given HubSpot account. Searches can be filtered by content type, domain, or URL path. Includes options for weighing results by recency and popularity, along with language support.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `analytics?: boolean`\n\n- `autocomplete?: boolean`\n\n- `boostLimit?: number`\n\n- `boostRecent?: string`\n\n- `domain?: string[]`\n\n- `groupId?: number[]`\n\n- `hubdbQuery?: string`\n\n- `language?: string`\n\n- `length?: 'LONG' | 'SHORT'`\n\n- `limit?: number`\n  The maximum number of results to display per page.\n\n- `matchPrefix?: boolean`\n\n- `offset?: number`\n\n- `pathPrefix?: string[]`\n\n- `popularityBoost?: number`\n\n- `property?: string[]`\n\n- `q?: string`\n\n- `tableId?: number`\n\n- `type?: string[]`\n\n- `types?: string[]`\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ limit: number; offset: number; page: number; results: { id: number; domain: string; score: number; type: string; url: string; authorFullName?: string; category?: string; combinedId?: string; contentType?: string; description?: string; featuredImageUrl?: string; inBeta?: boolean; isPrivate?: boolean; language?: string; publishedDate?: number; rowId?: number; subcategory?: string; tableId?: number; tags?: string[]; title?: string; }[]; total: number; searchTerm?: string; }`\n\n  - `limit: number`\n  - `offset: number`\n  - `page: number`\n  - `results: { id: number; domain: string; score: number; type: string; url: string; authorFullName?: string; category?: string; combinedId?: string; contentType?: string; description?: string; featuredImageUrl?: string; inBeta?: boolean; isPrivate?: boolean; language?: string; publishedDate?: number; rowId?: number; subcategory?: string; tableId?: number; tags?: string[]; title?: string; }[]`\n  - `total: number`\n  - `searchTerm?: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport HubSpot from '@hubspot/sdk';\n\nconst client = new HubSpot();\n\nconst publicSearchResults = await client.cms.siteSearch.search();\n\nconsole.log(publicSearchResults);\n```",
